@PolicyService.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5000

### Policies

POST {{PolicyService.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/policies/
Content-Type: application/json
X-Tenant-Id: 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

{
  "name": "api-rate-limit",
  "condition": "request.path == \"/api/v1/feed\"",
  "expression": "allow",
  "priority": 100
}

###

GET {{PolicyService.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/policies/
X-Tenant-Id: 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

###

GET {{PolicyService.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/policies/{policyId}
X-Tenant-Id: 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

###

POST {{PolicyService.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/policies/{policyId}/publish
X-Tenant-Id: 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

###

POST {{PolicyService.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/policies/{policyId}/archive
X-Tenant-Id: 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

###

PATCH {{PolicyService.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/policies/{policyId}/condition
Content-Type: application/json
X-Tenant-Id: 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

{
  "condition": "request.path == \"/api/v1/feed\"",
  "expression": "allow"
}

